  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of cross-cutting indicators and gathering of IATI-experience to inform results reporting for SPA 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the assignment is 1) to have a clear set of cross-cutting indicators relevant for partners and MFA to report against during the Strategic Partnership period (2022-2025) and  2) to have an informed background to decide on future IATI-reporting requirements in the SPA 2022-2025 and other HCE-partners.</narrative>
